# ReducedGSF pivot energies [GeV per nucleon], one per line.
# Derived for the 2026-S23e variant with optimize_pivots(n_pivots=12,
# n_grid=300, n_restarts=4, seed=0), polished on round values (2026-08-04;
# 601-point verification grid). Worst-case coverage factor of the total p/n
# sigma over 1-1e9 GeV/n: 1.36 (the 2026 default grid gives 1.53 here).
# NOTE: theta components are defined at these energies and therefore do NOT
# line up 1:1 with the 2026 default's components.
